## 🤖 AI-Generated Content Indicators

These patterns across the site strongly suggest AI-generated content:

1. **Buzzword-heavy headings**: "Transforming Ideas into Digital Reality", "Building the Future of Technology", "Crafting Digital Excellence"
2. **Repeating section patterns**: Every service page uses identical structure (Hero → Features → Process → CTA)
3. **Generic mission/vision statements**: "To be the global leader in transformative technology solutions"
4. **Template value propositions**: "Innovation", "Excellence", "Integrity", "Collaboration" — classic ChatGPT output
5. **Fake testimonials with stereotypical names**: Western names (Sarah, Michael, Emily) for what appears to be an Indian company
6. **Inflated metrics with no evidence**: 500+ clients, 100M+ revenue, 99% satisfaction
7. **Template email addresses**: `@company.com` instead of `@techuniqueiit.com`
8. **"Founded 2015"** on one page, **"Founded 2022"** on another
9. **Test data visible**: "this is the test", "this is 2nd", "this is title test"

